---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service — RBT Practice Exam"
  description="Terms of Service for using the free RBT examination prep tools, practice tests, and study materials on rbtpracticeexam.xyz."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-12 space-y-8 animate-fadeIn">
    <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6 space-y-2">
      <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">
        Terms & Conditions
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
        Last Updated: August 2026 • rbtpracticeexam.xyz
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using <strong>RBT Practice Exam</strong> (<code>https://rbtpracticeexam.xyz</code>), you acknowledge and agree to comply with these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use this platform.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Educational Use Only</h2>
        <p>
          All questions, clinical rationale, flashcards, study guides, and mock exams provided on this platform are for independent study and exam preparation purposes only. While curated according to BACB task list standards, this material does not constitute professional medical, clinical, or behavior analyst supervision advice.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Intellectual Property & Fair Use</h2>
        <p>
          The layout, code, software design, and original pedagogical explanations on <code>rbtpracticeexam.xyz</code> are protected by intellectual property laws. You may use this platform for personal non-commercial educational study. Automated scraping or bulk unauthorized redistribution of question datasets is prohibited.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          RBT Practice Exam provides all services on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind. We strive for 100% clinical accuracy, but cannot guarantee that examination results will reflect platform mock test scores.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          For any legal or terms inquiries, please contact our administrative desk at: <a href="mailto:support@rbtpracticeexam.xyz" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 font-bold underline">support@rbtpracticeexam.xyz</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
